<title>USA: FGIC has capacity for New York City GO bonds.</title>
<headline>FGIC has capacity for New York City GO bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co. said Wednesday it has limited secondary market insurance capacity for New York City general obligation bonds with a maturity limitation of 8/21/2026.</p>
<p>Capacity is initially limited to $15 million per firm, FGIC said. For more information, call 212-312-3020.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
